title: a3 Objective Stories
syntax: xwiki/2.1
%%WIKI-SYNC-META%%
**Abstract.** Three short stories, each tying a Function to the value it serves, in a stakeholder's own words. Why walking comes first (OS-01). Why the guide states and never asks (OS-02). Why listening starts from the resident's own station (OS-03). Voices are provisional: written by the group, not yet heard from stakeholders.

= Objective Story - The walk itself [OS-01] =

**Report Format:** §2.2 Personas and Profiles

== Fields ==

|=Field|=Description
|ID|OS-01
|Name|The walk itself
|Status|In Progress
|Evidence basis|Provisional. Group reasoning; HFC-01 (hypothesis), HFC-02.
|Narrative|//Myra:// "On days Jan walks, Jan talks about it at dinner - the blackbird, the pond. On days Jan sits in the lounge, Jan has nothing to tell. The guide gives the walk something to notice along the way, so Jan does not need to remember where they were going."
|Concerns|F2 Guide the walk; HV-05 Well-being

= Objective Story - Ask, don't test [OS-02] =

**Report Format:** §2.2 Personas and Profiles

== Fields ==

|=Field|=Description
|ID|OS-02
|Name|Ask, don't test
|Status|In Progress
|Evidence basis|Provisional. Group reasoning; HFC-04, HFC-06; IDP-02.
|Narrative|//Jan's daughter, to Sanne:// "Ask Jan whether they remember the harbour and you get 'Of course I do', and then nothing. When the voice says the ropes smelled of tar, Jan starts talking and goes on for ten minutes."
|Concerns|F2 Guide the walk (memory invitations); HV-02 Dignity, HV-08 Identity

= Objective Story - My station [OS-03] =

**Report Format:** §2.2 Personas and Profiles

== Fields ==

|=Field|=Description
|ID|OS-03
|Name|My station
|Status|In Progress
|Evidence basis|Provisional. Group reasoning; HFC-05; PS-06.
|Narrative|//Jan:// "Brass band on Sunday, football on Saturday, and the news with my morning coffee. In the evening I want the news only if I ask for it. Give me a choice of two things, and leave that pop station off."
|Concerns|F6 Recommend listening; HV-01 Autonomy, HV-08 Identity

== Graph edges ==

OS-01: narrates → F2, HV-05; serves → OBJ-01.

OS-02: narrates → F2, HV-02, HV-08; serves → OBJ-03, OBJ-06.

OS-03: narrates → F6, HV-01, HV-08; serves → OBJ-05, OBJ-09.
